From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:50:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 67/86] Mermaid diagrams render in the Markdown preview

A ```mermaid block is rendered to SVG in process by mermaid-rs-renderer
(MIT, pure Rust, default features off; adds json5 to the tree) and drawn
centred, scaled down to fit, in dark or light colours with the theme.
Diagrams are cached per block like the code colours. Code that does not
parse, a block over 50 000 bytes or a renderer panic keeps the code block.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

